    "steam_appid": 3005490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/b8ea16b81eefcfb411ea5229d60b9522.avif?t=1748272729\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/a9cb62c7d35880ffdda5cf5393d0b262.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=576 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/a9cb62c7d35880ffdda5cf5393d0b262.webm?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Rise Achlys&quot;</strong></i> delves into a dark and dramatic narrative, exploring themes of tragedy, sacrifice, and the relentless pursuit of vengeance. At its core, it's a story of a young half-vampire named Achlys, raised by his foster family, only to witness their gruesome murder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fueled by a desire for revenge and the longing to resurrect his loved ones, Achlys embarks on a harrowing journey to find his true father, the enigmatic Dracula. Achlys will lose everything he holds dear along this treacherous path, ultimately evolving into a character of profound strength and maturity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/865682b590ba3625a0c3525c1e5a1d5f.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/865682b590ba3625a0c3525c1e5a1d5f.webm?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/865682b590ba3625a0c3525c1e5a1d5f.mp4?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/05dd525433ca183c4f78debba6eefada.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=576 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/05dd525433ca183c4f78debba6eefada.webm?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a Time-Traveling Adventure:</strong> Join Achlys, the son of Dracula, with the assistance of Dr. Frankenstein, as you journey through different eras and environments. Traverse the past and future, and carve your path into endless possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/18d265b8fc73a07c16a8e06db152c5cd.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/18d265b8fc73a07c16a8e06db152c5cd.webm?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/18d265b8fc73a07c16a8e06db152c5cd.mp4?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Fire, Shadow, and Blood:</strong> Achlys boasts an extensive skill tree, offering diverse abilities across these powerful subtypes. You can choose to specialize in one, or master all three! Customize your abilities and create your unique character build. Shape your vampire persona and play style to your liking, becoming the ultimate vampire warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/1ec31a41ab800784e97cb6eebe39a953.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/1ec31a41ab800784e97cb6eebe39a953.webm?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/1ec31a41ab800784e97cb6eebe39a953.mp4?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform into Three Animals: </strong>As the son of Dracula, Achlys possesses the ability to transform into a wolf, rat, or bat, mirroring the powers described in Bram Stoker's original Dracula novel. Each form offers unique skills and advantages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a bat, Achlys soars through the air, gracefully dodging enemy attacks until his stamina wanes. In wolf form, he becomes a whirlwind of speed and ferocity, unleashing devastating assaults. Transforming into a rat, he slips through narrow passages like pipes, uncovering secret pathways hidden from sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/12f1c89ff795c249a981af0217b9612a.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/12f1c89ff795c249a981af0217b9612a.webm?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/12f1c89ff795c249a981af0217b9612a.mp4?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Non-linear Levels:</strong> Navigate the unique, expansive universe of Rise Achlys, venturing through diverse time periods and locations. Engage with intricate level designs featuring a variety of platforms, from moving and crumbling platforms to those that react to your actions. Overcome dynamic obstacles and uncover hidden paths as you interact with every element in the environment. Travel through time and master each meticulously crafted level, forging your own path to the finish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/18c4438d385bee4dac72e66dfec6472e.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/18c4438d385bee4dac72e66dfec6472e.webm?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/18c4438d385bee4dac72e66dfec6472e.mp4?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/b8ea16b81eefcfb411ea5229d60b9522.avif?t=1748272729\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/a9cb62c7d35880ffdda5cf5393d0b262.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=576 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/a9cb62c7d35880ffdda5cf5393d0b262.webm?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Rise Achlys&quot;</strong></i> delves into a dark and dramatic narrative, exploring themes of tragedy, sacrifice, and the relentless pursuit of vengeance. At its core, it's a story of a young half-vampire named Achlys, raised by his foster family, only to witness their gruesome murder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fueled by a desire for revenge and the longing to resurrect his loved ones, Achlys embarks on a harrowing journey to find his true father, the enigmatic Dracula. Achlys will lose everything he holds dear along this treacherous path, ultimately evolving into a character of profound strength and maturity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/865682b590ba3625a0c3525c1e5a1d5f.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/865682b590ba3625a0c3525c1e5a1d5f