s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/12f1c89ff795c249a981af0217b9612a.mp4?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Non-linear Levels:</strong> Navigate the unique, expansive universe of Rise Achlys, venturing through diverse time periods and locations. Engage with intricate level designs featuring a variety of platforms, from moving and crumbling platforms to those that react to your actions. Overcome dynamic obstacles and uncover hidden paths as you interact with every element in the environment. Travel through time and master each meticulously crafted level, forging your own path to the finish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/18c4438d385bee4dac72e66dfec6472e.poster.avif?t=1748272729\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/18c4438d385bee4dac72e66dfec6472e.webm?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005490/extras/18c4438d385bee4dac72e66dfec6472e.mp4?t=1748272729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
